WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to the Box Preview video demonstration.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Today we are showcasing auto-generated subtitles.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
This video contains speech in the original language.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Subtitles are loaded from the local transcript server.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
You can switch between different languages in settings.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Each subtitle track is synchronized with the player.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
This is a CCP 2026 hackathon demonstration.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Transcription helps users understand video content.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Subtitles appear at the bottom of the screen during playback.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
You can turn off subtitles at any time.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Thank you for watching this presentation.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
End of the video subtitles demonstration.
